judge_panel.matching_evidence:
Equation (9) does not actually enforce a path to an RSU. The stated constraint

    yᵢ ≤ Σⱼ∈V 𝕀{path exists from i to j}

   sums the indicator over all nodes j ∈ V rather than j ∈ V_RSU, so any CAV with a path to any other node (including any CAV) satisfies the constraint.
